              <p>
                Colour is not approved on a screen, and it is not approved by
                eye. It is approved as a set of Pantone codes printed on a proof,
                signed before production starts — because a code is the one thing
                in the conversation that does not change when the monitor, the
                lighting or the person looking at it changes.
              </p>
            </section>

            <!-- ---------- 01 ---------- -->
            <section
              id="screen"
