                <div>
                  <p class="color-section__eyebrow">Standard</p>
                  <h2>Pantone is the working standard</h2>
                </div>
              </header>

              <p>
                In a metal workshop, colour is not matched to a file. It is
                matched to a Pantone code, and that code is the reference the
                whole shop organises around: the mixing bench, the sample room,
                the inspection bench, and the reorder two years later all read
                from the same number.
              </p>

              <div class="color-steps">
                {mixSteps.map((step) => (
